# The VSIX ships everything the extension needs at runtime:
#   extension.js, package.json, readme.md, CHANGELOG.md, LICENSE
#   scripts/            the mirror and AVD manager servers
#   src/wgccap/bin/     the built WGC capturer (wgccap.exe + its runtime pack)
# so an installed copy works in any workspace, with no project checkout nearby.
#
# Excluded: the dev-only harness and the internal design notes, the .NET sources
# and build intermediates (the built bin/ folder is what ships), the readme's
# screenshots (vsce rewrites those to absolute GitHub URLs, so they need not
# ship), and the packaging output. The PDB is debug symbols, which nothing
# loads at runtime.
harness.js
SKILL.md
*.vsix
.git/**
.gitignore
.vscodeignore
src/wgccap/obj/**
src/wgccap/*.cs
src/wgccap/*.csproj
src/wgccap/bin/**/*.pdb
media/screenshots/**
